.TH mnnn-ingest-path 1  "mnnn-ingest-path 2.22.3" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-ingest\-path \- Store a whole path: every CSV and JSON file in a directory tree (or one file), as they are
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn ingest path\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-symbol\fR] [\fB\-\-duration\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-log\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-map\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-rejects\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-progress\fR] [\fB\-\-transport\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-progress\fR] [\fB\-\-delimiter\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-header\fR] [\fB\-\-records\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Store a whole path: every CSV and JSON file in a directory tree (or one file), as they are
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-path\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Same as the positional PATH
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
The source to store into (created if unknown). Default: the source already holding this path, else the folder\*(Aqs name (a service: its host); asked only when there is none
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-symbol\fR \fI<SYMBOL>\fR
Ignored (warns): now the to\-bars option `symbol` (`code:to\-bars?symbol=BTC/USDT`)
.TP
\fB\-\-duration\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
Ignored (warns): now the to\-bars option `duration` (`code:to\-bars?duration=5m`)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write logs to this file instead of stderr (the TUI defaults to <home>/logs/tui.log)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_LOG_FILE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-map\fR \fI<COL=FIELD>\fR
Ignored (warns): now the to\-bars option `map` (`code:to\-bars?map=ts:timestamp`)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-rejects\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Ignored (warns): to\-bars passes rejected rows to its output (`rejects=fail` stops instead)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Store again even if these exact bytes are already in the source
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR
For a directory \-\-path: only its top level (default: search subdirectories too)
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-progress\fR
Show per\-file progress (bytes, rate, ETA) and a summary line per file on stderr. On by default when stderr is a terminal; when it is not, prints a plain line every few seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-transport\fR \fI<stream|poll>\fR
How live collaboration reaches peers: `stream` (gRPC streams, the default) or `poll` (requests over the peer connection; for containers). Overrides MUNINN_COLLAB_TRANSPORT and the `net config \-\-collab\-transport` setting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-progress\fR
Never show progress, even on a terminal
.TP
\fB\-\-delimiter\fR \fI<DELIMITER>\fR [default: ,]
Ignored (warns): now the parse\-csv option `delimiter`
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-header\fR
Ignored (warns): now the parse\-csv option `header=false`
.TP
\fB\-\-records\fR \fI<RECORDS>\fR
Ignored (warns): now the parse\-json option `records`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR]
File or directory; directories are searched recursively for .csv/.tsv/.txt and .json/.ndjson/.jsonl files (hidden entries skipped)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.22.3
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
